  "description": "-In a cursed haunted house, money that should have gone to the dead went to the woman, and like travel money from the afterlife, he opened his eyes. Choi Young-woo, a criminal, steals 40 million won in condolence money from Daheung's funeral home and immediately runs to the haunted house where he was staying to hide the money. Young-woo then discovers a mirror and a bell on a straw heap. Afterwards, Young-woo suffers from nightmares... What on earth did he discover? Meanwhile, it's not just Young-woo who has changed due to the haunted house. Seo-kyung, who was working as an elementary school teacher in Seopju, the neighboring town, begins to shed her naive appearance and become increasingly bold starting from that day. The curse that has been tainted by Seo-kyung, starting with Young-woo, begins here in Seopju.\n\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61102538), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%84%AD%EC%A3%BC/3269)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/171841)",
